t the image is resized directly to the ROI and then immediately to the final resolution, preserving higher image quality.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, included boxplots to visually represent the size distribution of the ROIs across different classes.", "created_at": "2023-05-29T08:56:57Z", "repo": "FasterRCNN-PyTorch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3c04530638eced01c306a1166147ccf0ad48dad8", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2023-05-27T23:57:08Z", "repo": "FasterRCNN-PyTorch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "32c6b43a523d7b471e3ee695ca50d6280cff821d", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2023-05-27T23:52:52Z", "repo": "FasterRCNN-PyTorch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7e73b066e25463b4808c55e6d9609545e1139e27", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2023-05-27T23:51:18Z", "repo": "FasterRCNN-PyTorch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "97afcf77f87119bdd96bc65ec9f55f7e82f11639", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2023-05-27T23:48:47Z", "repo": "FasterRCNN-PyTorch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "012fe834831540ab90cb88323de261e8984fbfd9", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2023-05-27T23:47:31Z", "repo": "FasterRCNN-PyTorch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e90af0c434d2699137bd9368c83ea3e730bd1562", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2023-05-27T23:34:09Z", "repo": "FasterRCNN-PyTorch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b5e6e6865f03e622a50164128d1cb3c2e75f435c", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2023-05-27T23:33:25Z", "repo": "FasterRCNN-PyTorch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ecb1c141bb83ad6716b1df9b332299230524335f", "message": "